  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hatched in the Shadow District, Cipher was always a bit…off. Exposure to experimental Nullpatch serums during a DRIP raid left him with a face that flickers in and out of existence, but also gave him an uncanny knack for predicting enemy movements. Now, he wanders Subchain City, searching for a cure...or maybe just more DRIP.",
    "class": "Shadow Recon",
    "name": "Cipher",
    "personality": "Cipher is enigmatic and unpredictable. His zombie eyes and glitched-out face combined with his dragon pants tend to make other ducks wary of him, but he views it as a benefit, as ducks tend to stay out of his way. Despite his unsettling appearance, he has a soft spot for hatchlings and will occasionally share scavenged DRIP.",
    "specialAbility": {
